<Placemark><name>Rally at Place de la République, 14:00 (12:30–15:00)</name><description><![CDATA[<b>CONFIRMED</b> · Sat 17 Oct 12:30–15:00 · last report 14:43<br><br>Sortiraparis (citing Le Parisien), Affiches Parisiennes (09:53) and Paris Rouge all report the Gilets Jaunes and union march leaving République at 14:00, which matches the Gilets Jaunes call (Aladom). Student and high-school groups also gather here. Police used tear gas at République around 12:38 with several hundred people already gathered (BFMTV, via Titres de presse), and groups heading here put up barricades from street barriers around 12:30 (Le Tribunal du Net). The prefecture counted 133 arrests in Paris at 14:00 (Humanité), and ICI later put it above 160. The prefecture counted 191 arrests in Paris by 18:00, 90% of them adults (Europe 1 live blog, 18:42; CNews headline). An ICI headline later gave 195 arrests in Paris, and CNews and franceinfo headlines gave about 1,200 nationwide. Al Jazeera reports police using stun grenades and tear gas here and trapping protesters between police lines. Authorities expected 30,000 to 60,000 people in Paris (Anadolu). The march then started from here despite tensions with police (franceinfo live headline). Clashes and wild processions in Paris are also reported (Epoch Times FR headline), without locations I could read. The march left the square around 14:45 (BFMTV, via Titres de presse), so this entry stops there. Clashes on the square continue under the separate clash entry.<br><br>Sources: <a href="https://www.letribunaldunet.fr/actualites/manifestation-17-octobre-incidents-avant-le-depart.html">Le Tribunal du Net, live blog with BFMTV items (17 Oct 13:01)</a> · <a href="https://www.titrespresse.com/25523422603/paris-manifestations-octobre">Titres de presse, BFMTV item: tear gas at République (17 Oct 12:38)</a> · <a href="https://www.franceinfo.fr/economie/greve/direct-mobilisation-du-17-octobre-lyceens-etudiants-gilets-jaunes-des-milliers-de-manifestants-attendus-dans-toute-la-france_8241022.html">franceinfo live, headlines: tear gas before the march; march leaves République despite tensions (17 Oct)</a> · <a href="https://www.epochtimes.fr/manifestations-du-17-octobre-des-affrontements-a-paris-la-mairie-de-marseille-investie-et-des-corteges-sauvages-3372149.html">Epoch Times FR, headline: clashes in Paris and wild processions (17 Oct)</a> · <a href="https://www.ici.fr/ile-de-france/paris-75/paris/mobilisation-du-17-octobre-des-tensions-avant-le-depart-de-la-manifestation-place-de-la-republique-a-paris-8202537">ICI (France Bleu) headline: 110,000 marchers in Paris, 195 arrests (updated after the 17 Oct evening; earlier version said more than 160)</a> · <a href="https://www.cnews.fr/">CNews live headline: 191 people arrested in Paris at 18:00, 90% adults (17 Oct)</a> · <a href="https://www.europe1.fr/societe/en-direct-mobilisation-du-17-octobre-800000-participants-selon-les-organisateurs-550000-selon-laurent-nunez-1156250">Europe 1 live blog, updated 20:10 (items 17:53, 18:42, 19:35, 19:51)</a> · <a href="https://cnews.fr/france/2026-10-17/mobilisation-du-17-octobre-18-heures-191-personnes-ont-ete-interpellees-paris">CNews live headline: at least 1,200 arrests nationwide (17 Oct, late evening)</a> · <a href="https://www.franceinfo.fr/economie/greve/direct-mobilisation-du-17-octobre-1-200-personnes-ont-ete-interpellees-selon-le-premier-ministre-qui-pointe-des-degres-de-violence-inacceptables_8242435.html">franceinfo live headline: 1,200 arrested, says the Prime Minister (17 Oct)</a> · <a href="https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/10/17/france-wave-of-nationwide-protests">Al Jazeera, scuffles and stun grenades at République (17 Oct)</a> · <a href="https://britbrief.co.uk/crime/violence/france-protests-tear-gas-fired-in-paris-as-600-rallies-planned.html">Brit Brief, tear gas and about 40 arrests in Paris (17 Oct, 10:43 UK time)</a> · <a href="https://www.cnn.com/2026/10/17/world/live-news/france-protests-paris-intl">CNN live, dozens detained in Paris (17 Oct, headline)</a> · <a href="https://www.anews.com.tr/europe/2026/10/17/yellow-vest-protesters-rally-in-france-with-support-from-students-farmers">Anadolu Agency (17 Oct 14:46)</a> · <a href="https://www.sortiraparis.com/actualites/a-paris/articles/353967-mobilisation-du-17-octobre-a-paris-quel-parcours-pour-la-manifestation-prevue-ce-samedi">Sortiraparis, route update (17 Oct 07:34)</a> · <a href="https://www.sortiraparis.com/actualites/a-paris/articles/353907-greve-du-17-octobre-2026-manif-gilets-jaunes-lyceens-transports-a-quoi-s-attendre-a-paris">Sortiraparis, what to expect (17 Oct)</a> · <a href="https://mesinfos.fr/75000-paris/manifestations-du-17-octobre-a-paris-parcours-metro-quartiers-interdits-341322.html">Affiches Parisiennes, routes and bans (17 Oct 09:53)</a> · <a href="https://parisrouge.fr/2026/10/16/mobilisation-du-17-octobre-un-parcours-de-manifestation-parisienne-finalement-autorise-entre-republique-et-place-de-clichy/">Paris Rouge, route authorised (16 Oct 22:37)</a> · <a href="https://www.aladom.fr/actualites/secteur-service/11364/manifestations-du-17-octobre-2026-ou-sont-prevus-les-rassemblements-a-paris-rennes-lille-grenoble-et-bordeaux/">Aladom, gathering calls (updated 16 Oct 10:56)</a>]]></description><styleUrl>#confirmed</styleUrl><Polygon><outerBoundaryIs><LinearRing><coordinates>2.366999,48.867599,0 2.366920,48.867069,0 2.366687,48.866560,0 2.366308,48.866091,0 2.365799,48.865680,0 2.365178,48.865343,0 2.364470,48.865092,0 2.363702,48.864938,0 2.362903,48.864886,0 2.362104,48.864938,0 2.361336,48.865092,0 2.360627,48.865343,0 2.360007,48.865680,0 2.359497,48.866091,0 2.359119,48.866560,0 2.358886,48.867069,0 2.358807,48.867599,0 2.358886,48.868128,0 2.359119,48.868637,0 2.359497,48.869106,0 2.360007,48.869517,0 2.360627,48.869855,0 2.361336,48.870105,0 2.362104,48.870260,0 2.362903,48.870312,0 2.363702,48.870260,0 2.364470,48.870105,0 2.365178,48.869855,0 2.365799,48.869517,0 2.366308,48.869106,0 2.366687,48.868637,0 2.366920,48.868128,0 2.366999,48.867599,0</coordinates></LinearRing></outerBoundaryIs></Polygon></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>March République → Place de Clichy (route authorised by the prefecture) (14:30–19:45)</name><description><![CDATA[<b>CONFIRMED</b> · Sat 17 Oct 14:30–19:45 · last report 18:48<br><br>Reported route: from République at 14:00 up Boulevard Magenta, past Barbès-Rochechouart, Anvers and Pigalle along Boulevard de Clichy to Place de Clichy. Sortiraparis, Affiches Parisiennes (09:53) and Paris Rouge (16 Oct, evening) all report this route as the one the prefecture authorised after talks failed; the Barbès, Anvers, Pigalle and Blanche stations close from 12:00. franceinfo says the procession started from République despite tensions with police and later that the protesters arrived at Place de Clichy; BFMTV says it left late (Titres de presse feed, about 14:20). I found no crowd figure or progress report along the route. Europe 1 (published 19:03, updated 19:21) says the head of the procession reached Place de Clichy shortly before 16:00 and that tens of thousands were still arriving in the late afternoon, with hooded people at the front but no clashes, and it reports no incident after 18:00. Interior Minister Nuñez put the Paris crowd at 110,000 and the national total at 550,000, and organisers claim more (Europe 1 live blog, 19:51). AFP at 19:07 says thousands of people marched calmly despite the violence elsewhere in Paris (summary only; the article body was not readable). A reaction quoted at 18:48 said Place de Clichy could not hold the crowd (Morandini live). Shown until about 19:45, an hour after that, since I found no report of where the crowd was later.<br><br>Sources: <a href="https://www.franceinfo.fr/economie/greve/direct-mobilisation-du-17-octobre-lyceens-etudiants-gilets-jaunes-des-milliers-de-manifestants-attendus-dans-toute-la-france_8241022.html">franceinfo live, headlines: tear gas before the march; march leaves République despite tensions (17 Oct)</a> · <a href="https://www.boursorama.com/actualite-economique/actualites/a-paris-malgre-le-chaos-des-manifestants-determines-a-se-faire-entendre-9eeedea99a1d5dfdcb6604998efbcc9e">AFP via Boursorama, 19:07 (only the summary was readable)</a> · <a href="https://www.europe1.fr/societe/en-direct-mobilisation-du-17-octobre-800000-participants-selon-les-organisateurs-550000-selon-laurent-nunez-1156250">Europe 1 live blog, updated 20:10 (items 17:53, 18:42, 19:35, 19:51)</a> · <a href="https://www.europe1.fr/societe/mobilisation-du-17-octobre-a-paris-les-casseurs-sement-le-chaos-les-manifestants-defilent-dans-le-calme-1157727">Europe 1, casseurs sèment le chaos, manifestants défilent dans le calme (17 Oct 19:03, updated 19:21)</a> · <a href="https://www.jeanmarcmorandini.com/article-654980-en-direct-17-oct-des-manifestants-en-cortege-sauvage-se-sont-approches-a-150-metres-de-l-elysee-l-office-du-tourisme-de-lyon-a-ete-brule-les-casseurs-sont-entres-a-la-mairie-de-marseille.html">Jean-Marc Morandini live blog, citing BFMTV and CNews (items 15:48 and 17:48)</a> · <a href="https://www.titrespresse.com/25533552603/pierre-antoine-valade">Titres de presse feed: Humanité live, BFMTV, actu.fr, HuffPost (about 14:20 to 14:45)</a> · <a href="https://www.sortiraparis.com/actualites/a-paris/articles/353967-mobilisation-du-17-octobre-a-paris-quel-parcours-pour-la-manifestation-prevue-ce-samedi">Sortiraparis, route update (17 Oct 07:34)</a> · <a href="https://www.sortiraparis.com/actualites/a-paris/articles/353907-greve-du-17-octobre-2026-manif-gilets-jaunes-lyceens-transports-a-quoi-s-attendre-a-paris">Sortiraparis, what to expect (17 Oct)</a> · <a href="https://mesinfos.fr/75000-paris/manifestations-du-17-octobre-a-paris-parcours-metro-quartiers-interdits-341322.html">Affiches Parisiennes, routes and bans (17 Oct 09:53)</a> · <a href="https://parisrouge.fr/2026/10/16/mobilisation-du-17-octobre-un-parcours-de-manifestation-parisienne-finalement-autorise-entre-republique-et-place-de-clichy/">Paris Rouge, route authorised (16 Oct 22:37)</a> · <a href="https://mesinfos.fr/75000-paris/manifestation-du-17-octobre-a-paris-quel-parcours-pour-le-cortege-341287.html">Affiches Parisiennes, 16 Oct</a>]]></description><styleUrl>#confirmed</styleUrl><Polygon><outerBoundaryIs><LinearRing><coordinates>2.326836,48.882199,0 2.325712,48.882704,0 2.325301,48.883157,0 2.325184,48.883681,0 2.325378,48.884195,0 2.325584,48.884423,0 2.326176,48.884778,0 2.326644,48.884939,0 2.327448,48.885026,0 2.328462,48.885598,0 2.329250,48.885761,0 2.330071,48.885704,0 2.332781,48.885076,0 2.337723,48.883608,0 2.338858,48.883416,0 2.346632,48.884895,0 2.349528,48.885221,0 2.349929,48.885214,0 2.350687,48.885047,0 2.351291,48.884700,0 2.351505,48.884475,0 2.351649,48.884227,0 2.351709,48.883790,0 2.357151,48.877734,0 2.358918,48.877477,0 2.359655,48.877149,0 2.359977,48.876894,0 2.360171,48.876643,0 2.360307,48.876090,0 2.360243,48.875811,0 2.359666,48.874923,0 2.364136,48.869932,0 2.364949,48.868881,0 2.365033,48.868620,0 2.364973,48.868114,0 2.365220,48.867556,0 2.365205,48.867290,0 2.364946,48.866790,0 2.364417,48.866393,0 2.364075,48.866253,0 2.363699,48.866160,0 2.362901,48.866128,0 2.362146,48.866300,0 2.360731,48.867127,0 2.360522,48.867349,0 2.360314,48.867853,0 2.360324,48.868115,0 2.360552,48.868588,0 2.360510,48.868664,0 2.355602,48.874150,0 2.355364,48.874606,0 2.355380,48.875080,0 2.354745,48.875309,0 2.354467,48.875490,0 2.353832,48.876119,0 2.348250,48.882336,0 2.347026,48.882168,0 2.345059,48.881774,0 2.344611,48.881614,0 2.343797,48.881530,0 2.341402,48.881062,0 2.340401,48.880640,0 2.339561,48.880551,0 2.336425,48.881031,0 2.331161,48.882577,0 2.329945,48.882858,0 2.328746,48.882284,0 2.328062,48.882114,0 2.327233,48.882115,0 2.326836,48.882199,0</coordinates></LinearRing></outerBoundaryIs></Polygon></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Clashes at Place de la République: car on fire, water cannon (12:30–19:00)</name><description><![CDATA[<b>CONFIRMED</b> · Sat 17 Oct 12:30–19:00 · last report 18:00<br><br>Before the march left, clashes were reported at République: a car was set on fire around 14:15 and police used a water cannon (BFMTV, Morandini, actu.fr, via Titres de presse). Humanité said the square was kettled by police and that protesters were being directed to join the procession by the grands boulevards instead of crossing it. The Interior Ministry blamed the ultra-left. AP, in a report from around 18:00, adds that a car and a newspaper kiosk were set on fire there and that police used tear gas and water cannon on hooded groups throwing fireworks. Avoid the square. Shown until about an hour after the latest report I found (AP, around 18:00).<br><br>Sources: <a href="https://www.titrespresse.com/25533552603/pierre-antoine-valade">Titres de presse feed: Humanité live, BFMTV, actu.fr, HuffPost (about 14:20 to 14:45)</a> · <a href="https://www.letribunaldunet.fr/actualites/manifestation-17-octobre-incidents-avant-le-depart.html">Le Tribunal du Net, live blog with BFMTV items (17 Oct 13:01)</a> · <a href="https://www.kpbs.org/news/international/2026/10/17/scuffles-and-fires-break-out-as-protesters-rally-across-france-joining-students">AP report, published about 17:57 Paris time (via KPBS)</a>]]></description><styleUrl>#confirmed</styleUrl><Polygon><outerBoundaryIs><LinearRing><coordinates>2.366453,48.867599,0 2.366384,48.867140,0 2.366182,48.866699,0 2.365854,48.866292,0 2.365413,48.865936,0 2.364875,48.865644,0 2.364261,48.865426,0 2.363595,48.865292,0 2.362903,48.865247,0 2.362210,48.865292,0 2.361545,48.865426,0 2.360931,48.865644,0 2.360393,48.865936,0 2.359952,48.866292,0 2.359624,48.866699,0 2.359422,48.867140,0 2.359353,48.867599,0 2.359422,48.868057,0 2.359624,48.868498,0 2.359952,48.868905,0 2.360393,48.869261,0 2.360931,48.869554,0 2.361545,48.869771,0 2.362210,48.869905,0 2.362903,48.869950,0 2.363595,48.869905,0 2.364261,48.869771,0 2.364875,48.869554,0 2.365413,48.869261,0 2.365854,48.868905,0 2.366182,48.868498,0 2.366384,48.868057,0 2.366453,48.867599,0</coordinates></LinearRing></outerBoundaryIs></Polygon></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Concorde and Élysée approaches: crowds pushed back despite the ban (15:30–18:50)</name><description><![CDATA[<b>CONFIRMED</b> · Sat 17 Oct 15:30–18:50 · last report 17:48<br><br>Around 15:48 a wild procession got within about 150 m of the Élysée (BFMTV, via Morandini). The prefecture says police pushed it back at the corner of Rue Boissy d'Anglas and Avenue Gabriel, next to Concorde (Europe 1, 16:35). At 17:48 dozens of rioters took over Place de la Concorde despite the ban, and CNews says hundreds of people were dispersed there (Morandini live). A tweet in that blog puts about 10,000 people in the 2nd arrondissement, which I could not verify. The area is under the gathering ban and Concorde métro is closed. Shown until about an hour after the latest report I found (17:48).<br><br>Sources: <a href="https://europe1.fr/police-justice/mobilisation-du-17-octobre-un-cortege-sauvage-aux-abords-de-lelysee-a-ete-refoule-selon-la-prefecture-de-police-1157427">Europe 1: prefecture says a wild procession near the Élysée was pushed back (17 Oct 16:35)</a> · <a href="https://www.jeanmarcmorandini.com/article-654980-en-direct-17-oct-des-manifestants-en-cortege-sauvage-se-sont-approches-a-150-metres-de-l-elysee-l-office-du-tourisme-de-lyon-a-ete-brule-les-casseurs-sont-entres-a-la-mairie-de-marseille.html">Jean-Marc Morandini live blog, citing BFMTV and CNews (items 15:48 and 17:48)</a>]]></description><styleUrl>#confirmed</styleUrl><Polygon><outerBoundaryIs><LinearRing><coordinates>2.325099,48.866803,0 2.325021,48.866273,0 2.324788,48.865765,0 2.324409,48.865295,0 2.323900,48.864884,0 2.323279,48.864547,0 2.322571,48.864296,0 2.321803,48.864142,0 2.321004,48.864090,0 2.320205,48.864142,0 2.319436,48.864296,0 2.318728,48.864547,0 2.318108,48.864884,0 2.317598,48.865295,0 2.317220,48.865765,0 2.316987,48.866273,0 2.316908,48.866803,0 2.316987,48.867332,0 2.317220,48.867841,0 2.317598,48.868310,0 2.318108,48.868721,0 2.318728,48.869059,0 2.319436,48.869309,0 2.320205,48.869464,0 2.321004,48.869516,0 2.321803,48.869464,0 2.322571,48.869309,0 2.323279,48.869059,0 2.323900,48.868721,0 2.324409,48.868310,0 2.324788,48.867841,0 2.325021,48.867332,0 2.325099,48.866803,0</coordinates></LinearRing></outerBoundaryIs></Polygon></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Wild marches and looting near Madeleine, Place Vendôme and Boulevard Haussmann (17:30–18:55)</name><description><![CDATA[<b>CONFIRMED</b> · Sat 17 Oct 17:30–18:55 · last report 17:53<br><br>At 17:53 the Europe 1 live blog reported several unauthorised marches in central Paris, near La Madeleine, Place Vendôme and the Champs-Élysées where gatherings are banned, and looting at the Galeries Lafayette on Boulevard Haussmann. No clock time is given for the looting, so the window is an estimate, and the circle covers the three places only roughly. The Champs-Élysées part is covered by the Concorde and ban entries. Shown until about an hour after the report; I found nothing later at this location.<br><br>Sources: <a href="https://www.europe1.fr/societe/en-direct-mobilisation-du-17-octobre-800000-participants-selon-les-organisateurs-550000-selon-laurent-nunez-1156250">Europe 1 live blog, updated 20:10 (items 17:53, 18:42, 19:35, 19:51)</a>]]></description><styleUrl>#confirmed</styleUrl><Polygon><outerBoundaryIs><LinearRing><coordinates>2.336103,48.870999,0 2.335967,48.870082,0 2.335563,48.869199,0 2.334907,48.868386,0 2.334024,48.867674,0 2.332948,48.867089,0 2.331721,48.866654,0 2.330389,48.866387,0 2.329004,48.866296,0 2.327619,48.866387,0 2.326287,48.866654,0 2.325060,48.867089,0 2.323984,48.867674,0 2.323101,48.868386,0 2.322445,48.869199,0 2.322041,48.870082,0 2.321905,48.870999,0 2.322041,48.871917,0 2.322445,48.872799,0 2.323101,48.873612,0 2.323984,48.874324,0 2.325060,48.874909,0 2.326287,48.875344,0 2.327619,48.875611,0 2.329004,48.875702,0 2.330389,48.875611,0 2.331721,48.875344,0 2.332948,48.874909,0 2.334024,48.874324,0 2.334907,48.873612,0 2.335563,48.872799,0 2.335967,48.871917,0 2.336103,48.870999,0</coordinates></LinearRing></outerBoundaryIs></Polygon></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Barricade fire and clashes near Réaumur-Sébastopol and Rue Saint-Denis (16:30–18:30)</name><description><![CDATA[<b>CONFIRMED</b> · Sat 17 Oct 16:30–18:30 · last report 17:19<br><br>About fifty people were dispersed after building a barricade from wooden barriers, setting it on fire and throwing objects at police in the Réaumur-Sébastopol and Saint-Denis districts, and hundreds clashed with police in the city centre (Around Prague, 17:19). The time of day was not given and the circle is approximate. The time of the fire is not given. The report was published at 17:19, so the window on the map is an estimate.<br><br>Sources: <a href="https://aroundprague.cz/en/news/world/protests-in-france-turn-into-street-battles-tear-gas-water-cannon-and-arson">Around Prague, clashes in Réaumur-Sébastopol and Saint-Denis (17 Oct 17:19)</a>]]></description><styleUrl>#confirmed</styleUrl><Polygon><outerBoundaryIs><LinearRing><coordinates>2.357865,48.866504,0 2.357781,48.865940,0 2.357533,48.865397,0 2.357129,48.864897,0 2.356586,48.864458,0 2.355924,48.864098,0 2.355168,48.863831,0 2.354349,48.863666,0 2.353496,48.863610,0 2.352644,48.863666,0 2.351825,48.863831,0 2.351069,48.864098,0 2.350407,48.864458,0 2.349864,48.864897,0 2.349460,48.865397,0 2.349212,48.865940,0 2.349128,48.866504,0 2.349212,48.867069,0 2.349460,48.867612,0 2.349864,48.868112,0 2.350407,48.868551,0 2.351069,48.868911,0 2.351825,48.869178,0 2.352644,48.869343,0 2.353496,48.869398,0 2.354349,48.869343,0 2.355168,48.869178,0 2.355924,48.868911,0 2.356586,48.868551,0 2.357129,48.868112,0 2.357533,48.867612,0 2.357781,48.867069,0 2.357865,48.866504,0</coordinates></LinearRing></outerBoundaryIs></Polygon></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Police charge and tear gas on Rue du Faubourg-Saint-Denis (10th) (11:15–14:00)</name><description><![CDATA[<b>CONFIRMED</b> · Sat 17 Oct 11:15–14:00 · last report 13:01<br><br>At 11:45 police charged a kettled group and used tear gas on Rue du Faubourg-Saint-Denis (Le Tribunal du Net, 13:01). A group of about 300 students, pupils and rail unionists was also reported forming in the 10th arrondissement, with clashes with police (L'Humanité, via Titres de presse). The exact spot was not given, so the circle is approximate. The latest report I found is from 13:01, so this is off the map after 14:00.<br><br>Sources: <a href="https://www.letribunaldunet.fr/actualites/manifestation-17-octobre-incidents-avant-le-depart.html">Le Tribunal du Net, live blog with BFMTV items (17 Oct 13:01)</a> · <a href="https://www.titrespresse.com/25523422603/paris-manifestations-octobre">Titres de presse, BFMTV item: tear gas at République (17 Oct 12:38)</a>]]></description><styleUrl>#confirmed</styleUrl><Polygon><outerBoundaryIs><LinearRing><coordinates>2.362193,48.876199,0 2.362093,48.875529,0 2.361798,48.874884,0 2.361319,48.874290,0 2.360673,48.873769,0 2.359887,48.873342,0 2.358990,48.873024,0 2.358017,48.872829,0 2.357005,48.872763,0 2.355993,48.872829,0 2.355020,48.873024,0 2.354123,48.873342,0 2.353337,48.873769,0 2.352692,48.874290,0 2.352212,48.874884,0 2.351917,48.875529,0 2.351817,48.876199,0 2.351917,48.876870,0 2.352212,48.877514,0 2.352692,48.878108,0 2.353337,48.878629,0 2.354123,48.879057,0 2.355020,48.879374,0 2.355993,48.879570,0 2.357005,48.879636,0 2.358017,48.879570,0 2.358990,48.879374,0 2.359887,48.879057,0 2.360673,48.878629,0 2.361319,48.878108,0 2.361798,48.877514,0 2.362093,48.876870,0 2.362193,48.876199,0</coordinates></LinearRing></outerBoundaryIs></Polygon></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Police checks at Gare Saint-Lazare forecourt (10:00–11:30)</name><description><![CDATA[<b>CONFIRMED</b> · Sat 17 Oct 10:00–11:30 · last report 10:39<br><br>Around 10:30 the BRAV-M police unit intervened at the Saint-Lazare forecourt to check protesters gathering, and officers asked passers-by for ID (Le Tribunal du Net, Dawn / AFP). A group of several dozen then moved off through the city. Train station surroundings are covered by the gathering ban. I found no report after about 10:40, so this is off the map from 11:30.<br><br>Sources: <a href="https://www.letribunaldunet.fr/actualites/manifestation-17-octobre-incidents-avant-le-depart.html">Le Tribunal du Net, live blog with BFMTV items (17 Oct 13:01)</a> · <a href="https://www.dawn.com/news/2037825/france-faces-day-of-cost-of-living-protests">Dawn / AFP, about 60 detained, ID checks at Saint-Lazare (17 Oct)</a>]]></description><styleUrl>#confirmed</styleUrl><Polygon><outerBoundaryIs><LinearRing><coordinates>2.328608,48.876299,0 2.328550,48.875911,0 2.328379,48.875537,0 2.328102,48.875193,0 2.327728,48.874892,0 2.327273,48.874644,0 2.326754,48.874461,0 2.326191,48.874347,0 2.325605,48.874309,0 2.325019,48.874347,0 2.324455,48.874461,0 2.323936,48.874644,0 2.323481,48.874892,0 2.323107,48.875193,0 2.322830,48.875537,0 2.322659,48.875911,0 2.322601,48.876299,0 2.322659,48.876687,0 2.322830,48.877060,0 2.323107,48.877404,0 2.323481,48.877706,0 2.323936,48.877953,0 2.324455,48.878137,0 2.325019,48.878250,0 2.325605,48.878288,0 2.326191,48.878250,0 2.326754,48.878137,0 2.327273,48.877953,0 2.327728,48.877706,0 2.328102,48.877404,0 2.328379,48.877060,0 2.328550,48.876687,0 2.328608,48.876299,0</coordinates></LinearRing></outerBoundaryIs></Polygon></Placemark>
