<Folder><name>Sun 18 Oct: road and transport disruption</name>
<Placemark><name>Bois de Vincennes half marathon: forest roads closed to vehicles (08:30–12:00)</name><description><![CDATA[<b>TRAFFIC</b> · Sun 18 Oct 08:30–12:00<br><br>A police order closes forest roads to all vehicles. From 08:30 to 12:00: Avenue de Nogent (Route des Sabotiers to Avenue de la Pépinière, and Avenue de Fontenay to Route de la Belle Gabrielle), Avenue de Tremblay (Route de Mortemart to Route du Champ de Manœuvre), Route du Champ de Manœuvre, Route de la Ferme (Beauté junction to Route de la Tourelle) and the Beauté junction. From 08:30 to 11:00: Route de la Tourelle (Route de la Ferme to Route du Pesage), the Ferme de la Faisanderie junction, Avenue Daumesnil (Route de la Tourelle to Avenue de Saint-Maurice) and Avenue de Saint-Maurice (Avenue Daumesnil to Avenue de Gravelle). Nogent-sur-Marne has its own municipal order, which I could not read. The 21.1 km course stays inside the forest, two laps (north, then south), with about 6,000 runners last year. Sortiraparis reports no bus or métro change; line 1 serves Château de Vincennes. The circle only marks the forest sector and is approximate; the roads above are the exact list. Parked cars on closed roads can be towed.<br><br>Sources: <a href="https://www.sortiraparis.com/en/news/in-paris/articles/353501-bois-de-vincennes-half-marathon-2026-roads-closed-on-october-18">Sortiraparis, Bois de Vincennes half marathon road closures (police order 2026-01276)</a>]]></description><styleUrl>#traffic</styleUrl><Polygon><outerBoundaryIs><LinearRing><coordinates>2.464572,48.834499,0 2.464100,48.831323,0 2.462702,48.828269,0 2.460431,48.825455,0 2.457375,48.822988,0 2.453651,48.820963,0 2.449402,48.819459,0 2.444792,48.818533,0 2.439998,48.818220,0 2.435204,48.818533,0 2.430594,48.819459,0 2.426345,48.820963,0 2.422621,48.822988,0 2.419565,48.825455,0 2.417294,48.828269,0 2.415896,48.831323,0 2.415424,48.834499,0 2.415896,48.837674,0 2.417294,48.840728,0 2.419565,48.843543,0 2.422621,48.846009,0 2.426345,48.848034,0 2.430594,48.849538,0 2.435204,48.850465,0 2.439998,48.850777,0 2.444792,48.850465,0 2.449402,48.849538,0 2.453651,48.848034,0 2.457375,48.846009,0 2.460431,48.843543,0 2.462702,48.840728,0 2.464100,48.837674,0 2.464572,48.834499,0</coordinates></LinearRing></outerBoundaryIs></Polygon></Placemark>
