<Folder><name>Métro stations that may close</name>
<Placemark><name>Métro Charles de Gaulle–Étoile (may close)</name><description>Lines 1, 2, 6, RER A. RATP announced these closures at the request of the Préfecture de police: trains pass through without stopping and there are no connections. The stations closed from 12:00 reopen only when the prefecture allows it. République, Oberkampf and Richard-Lenoir are not on the list, but the prefecture can add closures at short notice. Line 6 ends at Kléber from 08:00. Station positions on the map are approximate. Several bus routes will be diverted.</description><styleUrl>#station</styleUrl><Point><coordinates>2.294996,48.873902,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
